WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.032
When Han Xin was young, his family was poor and his life was very hard.

00:00:04.382 --> 00:00:07.334
He often went hungry, and his clothes were worn and shabby.

00:00:07.684 --> 00:00:11.692
In his worn clothes, he stood out in front of the crowd.

00:00:12.042 --> 00:00:16.410
One day, a ruffian deliberately blocked his path and humiliated him in public.

00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:20.960
People around them stopped to watch, murmuring among themselves.

00:00:21.310 --> 00:00:26.062
The ruffian pointed between his own legs and demanded that Han Xin crawl through there.

00:00:26.412 --> 00:00:29.964
Han Xin clenched his fists, angry and hurt inside.

00:00:30.314 --> 00:00:35.402
Han Xin was furious inside, but he held it in and silently crawled through.

00:00:35.752 --> 00:00:39.400
Some in the crowd snickered, while others felt it was unfair to him.

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:43.902
After crawling through, he stood up, brushed the dust from his clothes, and quietly walked away.

00:00:44.252 --> 00:00:48.500
Many years later, Han Xin became an important general of Liu Bang, proving the power of endurance.

00:00:48.850 --> 00:00:52.978
So endurance is not weakness — it is holding on for a greater goal.

00:00:53.328 --> 00:00:57.360
When people of later years speak of him, they admire his endurance and his vision.

